@startuml MyBatis-缓存机制类图
title MyBatis 缓存机制类图（源码导向）

top to bottom direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package "配置与映射" {
  class Configuration {
    -caches: Map<String, Cache>
    -cacheEnabled: boolean = true
    -localCacheScope: LocalCacheScope = SESSION
    +addCache(cache: Cache)
    +getCache(id: String): Cache
    +newExecutor(transaction: Transaction): Executor
  }

  class MapperBuilderAssistant {
    -currentCache: Cache
    +useNewCache(...): Cache
    +useCacheRef(namespace: String): Cache
    +addMappedStatement(...): MappedStatement
  }

  class MappedStatement {
    -cache: Cache
    -useCache: boolean
    -flushCacheRequired: boolean
    +getCache(): Cache
    +isUseCache(): boolean
    +isFlushCacheRequired(): boolean
  }

  enum LocalCacheScope {
    SESSION
    STATEMENT
  }
}

package "执行器缓存" {
  interface Executor

  abstract class BaseExecutor {
    -localCache: PerpetualCache = new PerpetualCache("LocalCache")
    -localOutputParameterCache: PerpetualCache = new PerpetualCache("LocalOutputParameterCache")
    +query(...): List<E>
    +createCacheKey(...): CacheKey
    +clearLocalCache()
  }

  class CachingExecutor {
    -delegate: Executor
    -tcm: TransactionalCacheManager
    +query(...): List<E>
    +commit(required: boolean)
    +rollback(required: boolean)
  }

  class CacheKey {
    +update(object: Object)
  }

  class TransactionalCacheManager {
    -transactionalCaches: Map<Cache, TransactionalCache>
    +clear(cache: Cache)
    +getObject(cache: Cache, key: CacheKey): Object
    +putObject(cache: Cache, key: CacheKey, value: Object)
    +commit()
    +rollback()
  }

  class TransactionalCache {
    -delegate: Cache
    -entriesToAddOnCommit: Map<Object, Object>
    -entriesMissedInCache: Set<Object>
    +commit()
    +rollback()
  }
}

package "缓存实现与装饰器" {
  interface Cache {
    +getId(): String
    +putObject(key: Object, value: Object)
    +getObject(key: Object): Object
    +removeObject(key: Object): Object
    +clear()
  }

  class CacheBuilder {
    -implementation: Class<? extends Cache>
    -decorators: List<Class<? extends Cache>>
    -size: Integer
    -clearInterval: Long
    -readWrite: boolean
    -blocking: boolean
    +build(): Cache
  }

  class PerpetualCache
  class LruCache
  class FifoCache
  class SoftCache
  class WeakCache
  class ScheduledCache
  class SerializedCache
  class LoggingCache
  class SynchronizedCache
  class BlockingCache
}

' layout hints
Configuration -[hidden]down-> MapperBuilderAssistant
MapperBuilderAssistant -[hidden]down-> MappedStatement
Executor -[hidden]down-> BaseExecutor
BaseExecutor -[hidden]down-> CachingExecutor
Cache -[hidden]down-> CacheBuilder
PerpetualCache -[hidden]right-> LruCache
LruCache -[hidden]right-> ScheduledCache
ScheduledCache -[hidden]right-> SerializedCache
SerializedCache -[hidden]right-> LoggingCache
LoggingCache -[hidden]right-> SynchronizedCache
SynchronizedCache -[hidden]right-> BlockingCache
FifoCache -[hidden]down-> SoftCache
SoftCache -[hidden]down-> WeakCache

Configuration "1" o--> "*" Cache : namespace caches
Configuration --> LocalCacheScope
Configuration ..> CachingExecutor : cacheEnabled=true

MapperBuilderAssistant --> CacheBuilder : useNewCache()
MapperBuilderAssistant --> Configuration : addCache()/getCache()
MapperBuilderAssistant --> MappedStatement : cache/useCache/flushCacheRequired
MappedStatement --> Cache : namespace cache

Executor <|.. BaseExecutor
Executor <|.. CachingExecutor
BaseExecutor --> PerpetualCache : 一级缓存
BaseExecutor --> CacheKey
BaseExecutor --> LocalCacheScope
CachingExecutor o--> Executor : delegate
CachingExecutor --> TransactionalCacheManager : tcm
CachingExecutor --> MappedStatement : getCache()/flags
CachingExecutor --> Cache : 二级缓存入口
TransactionalCacheManager --> TransactionalCache : computeIfAbsent()
TransactionalCacheManager --> Cache : index key
TransactionalCache o--> Cache : delegate

Cache <|.. PerpetualCache
Cache <|.. LruCache
Cache <|.. FifoCache
Cache <|.. SoftCache
Cache <|.. WeakCache
Cache <|.. ScheduledCache
Cache <|.. SerializedCache
Cache <|.. LoggingCache
Cache <|.. SynchronizedCache
Cache <|.. BlockingCache
Cache <|.. TransactionalCache

LruCache o--> Cache : delegate
FifoCache o--> Cache : delegate
SoftCache o--> Cache : delegate
WeakCache o--> Cache : delegate
ScheduledCache o--> Cache : delegate
SerializedCache o--> Cache : delegate
LoggingCache o--> Cache : delegate
SynchronizedCache o--> Cache : delegate
BlockingCache o--> Cache : delegate

CacheBuilder ..> PerpetualCache : 默认基类
CacheBuilder ..> LruCache : 默认淘汰策略
CacheBuilder ..> FifoCache : 可选淘汰策略
CacheBuilder ..> SoftCache : 可选引用策略
CacheBuilder ..> WeakCache : 可选引用策略
CacheBuilder --> ScheduledCache : clearInterval
CacheBuilder --> SerializedCache : readWrite=true
CacheBuilder --> LoggingCache : 标准装饰器
CacheBuilder --> SynchronizedCache : 标准装饰器
CacheBuilder --> BlockingCache : blocking=true

note top of BaseExecutor
  一级缓存位于 Executor 内部。
  localCache 与 localOutputParameterCache
  都是 PerpetualCache。
  localCacheScope=STATEMENT 时，语句结束即清空。
end note

note top of CachingExecutor
  二级缓存生效条件：
  cacheEnabled=true、MappedStatement.cache!=null、
  useCache=true、resultHandler==null。
  flushCacheRequired=true 时先执行 tcm.clear(cache)。
end note

note top of CacheBuilder
  默认装配链：
  PerpetualCache -> LruCache -> ScheduledCache? ->
  SerializedCache? -> LoggingCache ->
  SynchronizedCache -> BlockingCache?
  自定义 Cache 实现不会套用用户 decorator；
  若缺少日志能力，仅补一层 LoggingCache。
end note

note bottom of TransactionalCache
  TransactionalCache 是二级缓存的事务缓冲层。
  查询 miss 先记录；提交时把 entriesToAddOnCommit 刷入真实 Cache；
  回滚时通过 removeObject() 释放 miss 对应的锁/占位。
end note

note bottom of CacheKey
  CacheKey 由 BaseExecutor.createCacheKey() 生成，
  组合 statementId、RowBounds、SQL、参数值、environmentId，
  同时服务于一级缓存和二级缓存。
end note

@enduml
